OL,3,GNEWSAMen in Sheds branch to get extra
OL,4,ACCTV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group set up to help people
OL,7,Ftackle loneliness and learn new skills
OL,8,Fhas been awarded council funding to
OL,9,Fimprove security.
OL,11,FMen in Sheds Hull, which meets at The
OL,12,FPavilion in Oak Road Playing Fields,
OL,13,Fhas been awarded up to #6,579 towards
OL,14,Fthe cost of installing additional CCTV
OL,15,Fto an area in the public car park.
OL,17,FA report that went before Hull City
OL,18,FCouncil's crime prevention grants
OL,19,Fsub-committee stated the area had
OL,20,Falmost daily instances of anti-social
OL,21,Fbehaviour, including suspected drug
OL,22,Fdealing and fly-tipping.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
